note right of HTTPB
  Epic 53: no service/dto package.
  Table-shaped bodies bind the JOOQ POJO
  (Account session + location, AccountRoleApplication).
  Non-table command bodies are read here and
  passed to IService as primitives; no Map into services.
  On-chain build/confirm (academy, agent authority, band vault,
  governance, royalty/geo, settle/claim, song pools, treasury,
  venue booking) take walletPubkey / txSignature / PDAs / amounts;
  song pool splits bind List<RoyaltySplit> (bps -> shareBps).
end note

note left of SOLRPC
  Epic 53: every Solana / Claude client is injected
  through its I* interface (service.interfaces).
  Repositories return JOOQ POJOs, lists of them, or counts;
  services compose the JSON (treasury inflows, digest metrics,
  level targets, member wallets) from those POJOs.
end note

note bottom of JOOQ
  Generated from live MariaDB.
  Never hand-write table DTOs.
  Domain wallet/PDA columns stay nullable.
  chain_config holds BCF-style RPC and program ids.
  Wallet session: POST /api/session/challenge then POST /api/session/wallet with the wallet signature. GET /api/session/current restores that session from the JWT account id with no new signature. GET session by wallet and location require the caller's own JWT.
  Academy product: GET /api/accounts,
  POST musicians / academy-subscriptions / enigma-evaluations.
  POST /api/musicians always stores Enigma level 0 + countryCode (alpha-3); level is agent-only.
  Bands product (APP-10-2): POST /api/bands,
  /band-members, /rehearsal-sessions,
  /rehearsal-checkins, /spp-cycles,
  GET /bands/{id}/rehearsals, close cycle.
  Stage product: POST /api/venues bookings concerts,
  settle (off-chain mirror), pending-claims/{id}/claim blocked.
  Catalog product: POST royalty-deposits, geo-subscriptions, tour-plans, channel-pieces.
  Epic 43: GET /geo-regions (onchainGeoCode); geo-subscriptions carry geoCode + months 1..12;
  academy-subscriptions carry months 1..12 (amount = plan price x months).
  Owner product: POST /owner-decisions/{id}/reject,
  POST /agents/{id}/semaphore (green|yellow|red).
  DevNet pay: GET/POST /devnet-pay-markers,
  POST academy-subscriptions/{id}/devnet-pay,
  POST pending-claims/{id}/devnet-claim (blocked — use claim-royalties/confirm).
  Academy on-chain (Epic 21): POST subscribe-academy/build + confirm;
  confirm requires DevNet RPC-confirmed signature (no intended-only paid).
  Settle/claim on-chain (Epic 22): POST /concert-settlements/{id}/settle-concert/build+confirm,
  POST /pending-claims/{id}/claim-royalties/build+confirm; confirm requires DevNet RPC-confirmed signature.
  Royalty/geo on-chain (Epic 23): POST deposit-royalties/build + confirm,
  POST subscribe-geographic/build + confirm; claim also uses claim-royalties/confirm;
  confirm requires DevNet RPC-confirmed signature (no intended-only paid).
  Agent events: GET /agent-events, POST /agents/{id}/tick
  (yellow/red insert owner_decision). Epic 46: NEXUS / HARMONY / ATLAS record events from real actions.
