  Studio ledger: every signed-in wallet reads solo-claims, band-claims, venue-expenses, instructor-shares, and my-allocation for that wallet, including a books editor. A books editor reads partners, show-fees, academy-fees, sync-fees, and allocations. Anyone else receives 403 on those books. Each fee is shared only with partners whose window covers that fee's calendar day. Allocations do not send USDC.
